First, let's define the contract. We need a stream of log lines.

**File:** `playbook.proto`

```protobuf
syntax = "proto3";

package playbook;

// Represents a single line of output from Ansible
message LogLine {
  string timestamp = 1;
  string host = 2;
  string message = 3;
}

// Request to start a playbook
message RunRequest {
  string playbook_path = 1;
  string inventory = 2;
  map<string, string> extra_vars = 3;
}

// Response from the server (streaming)
message RunResponse {
  LogLine log = 1;
  bool finished = 2;
}

// Service definition
service PlaybookService {
  // Runs a playbook and streams output
  rpc RunPlaybook (RunRequest) returns (stream RunResponse);
}
```

